    {
      "id": "higher_math_1st-ch7-mcq-002",
      "text": "ABC ত্রিভুজের তিনটি বাহু \\(a = 3,\\ b = 4\\) এবং \\(c = 5\\) হলে—",
      "text_en": null,
      "image": null,
      "statements": [
        {
          "label": "i",
          "text": "\\(5 = 4\\cos A + 3\\cos B\\)"
        },
        {
          "label": "ii",
          "text": "\\(\\cos\\dfrac{C}{2} = \\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\)"
        },
        {
          "label": "iii",
          "text": "\\(\\tan\\dfrac{A - C}{2} = \\dfrac{1}{4}\\cot\\dfrac{B}{2}\\)"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "a",
          "text": "i ও ii",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "b",
          "text": "i ও iii",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "c",
          "text": "ii ও iii",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "d",
          "text": "i, ii ও iii",
          "image": null
        }
      ],
      "answer": "a",
      "answer_source": "printed",
      "explanation": "\\(3^2+4^2=5^2\\), তাই \\(\\angle C=90^\\circ\\)।\ni. প্রক্ষেপ সূত্রে \\(c=a\\cos B+b\\cos A=3\\cos B+4\\cos A\\) — সত্য।\nii. \\(\\cos\\dfrac{C}{2}=\\cos45^\\circ=\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\) — সত্য।\niii. নেপিয়ার সূত্রে \\(\\tan\\dfrac{A-C}{2}=\\dfrac{a-c}{a+c}\\cot\\dfrac{B}{2}=-\\dfrac{1}{4}\\cot\\dfrac{B}{2}\\); চিহ্ন ভিন্ন — মিথ্যা।",
      "source": {
        "board": "BB",
        "year": "2023",
        "qno": 8,
        "session": null
      },
      "tags": [],
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "higher_math_1st-ch7-mcq-003",
      "text": "চিত্রের আলোকে কোন সম্পর্কটি সঠিক?",
