    {
      "id": "higher_math_1st-ch7-mcq-011",
      "text": "\\(\\cos\\theta = -\\dfrac{12}{13}\\) এবং \\(\\pi < \\theta < \\dfrac{3\\pi}{2}\\) হলে \\(\\tan\\theta\\) এর মান কত?",
