      ],
      "answer": "c",
      "answer_source": "printed",
      "explanation": "\\(\\theta\\) তৃতীয় চতুর্ভাগে, \\(\\sin\\theta=-\\sqrt{1-\\dfrac{144}{169}}=-\\dfrac{5}{13}\\)\n\\(\\tan\\theta=\\dfrac{\\sin\\theta}{\\cos\\theta}=\\dfrac{-5/13}{-12/13}=\\dfrac{5}{12}\\)",
      "source": {
