      "explanation": "\\(\\cot\\theta=\\dfrac{4}{3}\\), \\(\\theta\\) তৃতীয় চতুর্ভাগে: \\(\\sin\\theta=-\\dfrac{3}{5},\\ \\cos\\theta=-\\dfrac{4}{5}\\)।\ni. \\(\\sin\\theta=-\\dfrac{3}{5}\\), প্রদত্ত \\(\\dfrac{3}{5}\\) — মিথ্যা।\nii. \\(\\cos^2\\theta=\\dfrac{16}{25}\\) — সত্য।\niii. \\(\\operatorname{cosec}\\theta\\sec\\theta=\\left(-\\dfrac{5}{3}\\right)\\left(-\\dfrac{5}{4}\\right)=\\dfrac{25}{12}\\) — সত্য।",
