    {
      "id": "higher_math_1st-ch7-mcq-019",
      "text": "\\(\\Delta ABC\\) এ, \\(\\angle B = 60^\\circ,\\ \\angle C = 30^\\circ\\) এবং \\(b = 3\\sqrt{3}\\) একক হলে c এর দৈর্ঘ্য কত?",
