      "answer": "d",
      "answer_source": "printed",
      "explanation": "\\(A=180^\\circ-90^\\circ=90^\\circ\\)। সাইন সূত্রে \\(\\dfrac{c}{\\sin C}=\\dfrac{b}{\\sin B}\\)\n\\(c=\\dfrac{3\\sqrt{3}\\sin30^\\circ}{\\sin60^\\circ}=\\dfrac{3\\sqrt{3}\\cdot\\frac{1}{2}}{\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}}=3\\) একক।",
