      "explanation": "i. \\(\\cos2\\theta=\\cos^2\\theta-\\sin^2\\theta\\) — সত্য।\nii. \\(\\cos2\\theta=\\dfrac{1-\\tan^2\\theta}{1+\\tan^2\\theta}\\) — সত্য।\niii. \\(\\dfrac{\\cot^2\\theta-1}{\\operatorname{cosec}^2\\theta}=\\dfrac{\\cos^2\\theta-\\sin^2\\theta}{\\sin^2\\theta}\\cdot\\sin^2\\theta=\\cos2\\theta\\) — সত্য।",
